+      With JointPositionAction(scale=1.0, use_default_offset=True) and no
+      clip, a std of 1.0 meant the policy was sampling +-1 rad target jumps
+      (+-3 rad in the tails) at 50 Hz. Now that scale=0.5 and clip=(-3,3) are
